# N8N Webhooks — social/image_questions only now. blog, image_post, AND
# video generation no longer go through n8n at all (see worker/,
# src/app/api/jobs/[jobId]/{blog,image,video}/) — N8N_BLOG_WEBHOOK,
# N8N_BLOG_APPROVE_WEBHOOK, N8N_IMAGE_WEBHOOK, N8N_VIDEO_WEBHOOK,
# N8N_VIDEO_APPROVE_WEBHOOK, and N8N_VIDEO_APPROVE_BOTH_WEBHOOK are all
# retired. social is the only content type still on n8n.
